pnpm --dir apps/web exec vitest run src/duos/DuosBoard.test.tsx src/duos/DuosRoute.test.tsx src/i18n/i18n.test.ts src/wording.test.ts src/net/duos.test.ts
pnpm --dir apps/web typecheck
pnpm exec eslint apps/web e2e
cargo jackioh spec check
pnpm --dir apps/web test
```

## Done when

- [ ] Steps 1–8 are done, and every acceptance item of the issue has its test above.
- [ ] All 12 new tests pass.
- [ ] The web suite, typecheck, eslint, `cargo fmt --check` and `spec check` are green, with no check weakened.

## Risks

- **Rule 7:** the panel shows only the server's booleans and words, and adds no client-side check.
- **#1755 focus:** View the board must stay the first button, or the existing focus test breaks.
- **Guards:** each `proven_in` file needs an `it("R2092000 …")`, and each new `t("…")` literal needs a zh-CN entry.
- **Tests:** no real-time waits (an eslint rule forbids them), and reset the URL after each test.

## Open questions

- The header of `crates/server/src/duos/again.rs` still says "Nothing in the client calls it yet". The issue rules out server changes, so this plan leaves that comment for a follow-up.
- Decision 1 departs from the issue's `(token, …)` signature. A person may overrule it.

